 "name": "S4: Ch2, Operating cadence + exercises",
 "text_content": "Pages 135 to 166. Chapter 2, Operating cadence, plus the Chapter 2 exercises appendix.\n\nS\u014fn output (draft): S\u014fn's operating cadence, in two versions.\n\nTwo rhythms, not one:\nPre-opening cadence, now through January 2027. Capital, construction, hiring, systems build.\nIn-service cadence, January 2027 forward. A restaurant runs on daily service, weekly review, and seasonal menu turns. That is not a quarterly planning cycle and it should not be forced into one.\n\nName where they overlap and where they do not.",
 "description": "Pages 135 to 166. Chapter 2, Operating cadence, plus the Chapter 2 exercises appendix.\n\nS\u014fn output (draft): S\u014fn's operating cadence, in two versions.\n\nTwo rhythms, not one:\nPre-opening cadence, now through January 2027. Capital, construction, hiring, systems build.\nIn-service cadence, January 2027 forward. A restaurant runs on daily service, weekly review, and seasonal menu turns. That is not a quarterly planning cycle and it should not be forced into one.\n\nName where they overlap and where they do not.",
 "markdown_description": "**Pages 135 to 166.** Chapter 2, Operating cadence, plus the Chapter 2 exercises appendix.\n\n**S\u014fn output (draft):** S\u014fn's operating cadence, in two versions.\n\n**Two rhythms, not one:**\n*   Pre-opening cadence, now through January 2027. Capital, construction, hiring, systems build.\n*   In-service cadence, January 2027 forward. A restaurant runs on daily service, weekly review, and seasonal menu turns. That is not a quarterly planning cycle and it should not be forced into one.\n\nName where they overlap and where they do not.",
